# Typography: Satoshi

Use **Satoshi** for all text on this project: the current landing page, new sections, and any additional pages.

- Set `font-family` via `var(--font-sans)`, which is `'Satoshi', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif` in `src/index.css`.
- Do not introduce Geist, Inter, or any other display/body font.
- Do not hard-code a different `font-family` on components unless it is still Satoshi (or an icon font).
- Inherit from `body` (`font: inherit` on form controls). New CSS should not override the family.
- Satoshi is loaded from Fontshare in `index.html` (weights 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 900). If you need another weight, add it there rather than swapping fonts.
- Keep existing weight usage: 300 light copy, 500/600 headings and UI, 700 where already used.
